* The psect's header values are the ones at the psect statement, where r68 takes them: a value
* set again after the psect statement gave the later value (the epilogue named the expression).
* fixed: 9214890 2026-10-11 r68togas: psect values at the psect statement
* expect sym: A __os9_attrev 00008000
* expect text: 00014e71
AtRv set $8000
 psect psect_values,$101,AtRv,0,0,0
AtRv set $8002
 dc.w 1
 ends
